      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">finding a voice</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra is trying this new &lt;i&gt;vulnerability&lt;/i&gt; thing, but in the Horde she was conditioned every day that any boundary she draws would be ignored at best and used against her at worst. Letting people know what she cares about is even worse. She spent her entire life having her relationship with Adora used against her. Letting it show, letting everything show, takes more courage than anyone can really know.&lt;br&gt;Sheâ€™s always been strong, though.&lt;br&gt;(Or, Catra learns she can voice her needs and find them met)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
